  "fullDescription": "This pack includes 14 cute forest-themed stamp brushes for the Procreate app.\n\nThe set features adorable woodland elements such as owl, hedgehog, fox, acorn, mushroom, pine tree, butterfly, leaves, berries, flowers, tree stump, moon, stars, and other charming nature-inspired designs.\n\nAll elements are illustrated in a soft, cute, cohesive style with smooth shapes and balanced details, making them perfectly coordinated and easy to combine into sweet woodland compositions.\n\nThese Procreate doodle stamps are ideal for creating stickers, planner spreads, bullet journals, junk journals, digital scrapbooking layouts, coloring pages, nursery art, greeting cards, social media graphics, printable designs, and cozy forest-themed illustrations.\n\nYOUR PURCHASE INCLUDES:\n\n14 Stamp Brushes (.brushset file)\n\nA complete set of 14 forest-themed stamp brushes designed for cute illustrations, woodland designs, planner stickers and digital stationery.\n\nThese stamps are not pressure sensitive and can be used with Apple Pencil, third-party stylus, or even your finger.\n\nYou can easily adjust the color, size, and opacity of each brush inside Procreate.\n\nCompatible with Procreate version 4.1 and above.\n\nHow to import:\n\nAfter downloading the files, open your Files app and double tap (or right-click) the .brushset file — it will automatically import into Procreate.",
